<title>USA: Chester Cty, S.C., won by Wachovia. [CORRECTED 22:03 GMT]</title>
<headline>Chester Cty, S.C., won by Wachovia. [CORRECTED 22:03 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects to Wachovia Bank from J.C. Bradford &amp; Co in headline and text)</p>
<p>Wachovia Bank, said it won $3 million of Chester Cty, S.C., general obligation bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.2112 percent</p>
<p>(Corrects net interest cost from 5.2101 percent).</p>
</text>
